.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-brightness-down 1 "" "Sway Things 0.6.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-brightness\-down \- Make it darker by 5 %, not below 1 % for a backlight
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things brightness down\fR [\fB\-\-device\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Make it darker by 5 %, not below 1 % for a backlight
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-device\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
The backlight or keyboard light by its name in /sys/class/backlight or /sys/class/leds, e.g. `intel_backlight` or `tpacpi::kbd_backlight`
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
